First Hearth (firsthearth)

Inspired by Stone Age.

Game design, rules text, cards, buildings, code and art: Luis Montes. The rules are restated in our own words,
and the lore cards and buildings are our own designs (games/firsthearth/data/firsthearth-data.mjs, balance-checked by
games/firsthearth/tools/gen-data.mjs). Every texture is drawn by games/firsthearth/tools/make-textures.mjs; the sounds are
synthesised in code.

Built with cartwheel-engine and three.c (MIT). The font is the engine's built-in sans (see the engine's NOTICE).
